o, Narrated Game Menus, Chat Text to Speech, and Chat Transcription are available in English only.","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 (VRAM 6GB) / Radeon RX 5500 XT (VRAM 8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 80 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 16bit 48kHz WAVE format stereo<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These specs allow for the game to be played in 1080p/30fps with graphics setting at &quot;Lowest&quot;</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2070 (VRAM 8GB) / Radeon RX 5700 XT (VRAM 8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 80 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 16bit/24bit 48kHz WAVE format Stereo/Surround (5.1ch/7.1ch)/Spatial sound (headphone/speaker)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These specs allow for the game to be played in 1080p/60fps with graphics setting at &quot;Standard&quot;</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD."],"publishers":["Electronic Arts"],"release_date":"16 Feb, 2023"}